<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Admin Dashboard - <%= hospitalName %></title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      color: #333;
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .header {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 25px 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .header h1 { color: #d9534f; font-size: 24px; }
    .badge { background: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
    .menu-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .card h3 { color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 20px; }
    .card p { color: #666; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-donor { background-color: #3498db; }
    .btn-donor:hover { background-color: #2980b9; }
    .btn-patient { background-color: #e74c3c; }
    .btn-patient:hover { background-color: #c0392b; }
    .back-home { margin-top: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .back-home a { color: #555; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>🏥 <%= hospitalName %></h1>
    <span class="badge">Medical Admin Portal</span>
  </div>

  <div class="menu-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🩸 Registered Donors Directory</h3>
      <p>Access the database of registered blood donors sorted by recent signups and locations.</p>
      <a href="/hospital/donors" class="btn btn-donor">View Donor Details</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🚑 Patient Emergency Requests</h3>
      <p>Manage admitted patients requiring urgent blood matchmaking and view active requirements.</p>
      <a href="/hospital/patients" class="btn btn-patient">Manage Patient Requests</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="back-home">
    <a href="/">← Log Out / Back to Home</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
